{"id":"5ab2dcd23faf2b6d","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-t-predicate.md","title":"Actual Halting-Computation Predicate","display":"df-t-predicate — Actual Halting-Computation Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-t-predicate","aliases":["57-df-t-predicate"],"display":"df-t-predicate — Actual Halting-Computation Predicate","depends_on":["[[57-df-composition-operator]]","[[57-df-program-numbering]]","[[57-df-encoding]]","[[57-df-machine-coding]]","[[57-df-turing-machine]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-t-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-t-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-t-predicate — Actual Halting-Computation Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cf31091f58bf0b5\" href=\"?note=6cf31091f58bf0b5\" title=\"57-df-program-numbering\">57-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9c9625457efede7\" href=\"?note=b9c9625457efede7\" title=\"57-df-machine-coding\">57-df-machine-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in D_n\">\\(\\vec x\\in D_n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n\">\\(D_n\\)</span> 及打包约定取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e\">\\(M_e\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6cf31091f58bf0b5\" href=\"?note=6cf31091f58bf0b5\" title=\"57-df-program-numbering\">57-df-program-numbering</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Word}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{Word}_n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HistCode},\\operatorname{cdec},U\">\\(\\operatorname{HistCode},\\operatorname{cdec},U\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b9c9625457efede7\" href=\"?note=b9c9625457efede7\" title=\"57-df-machine-coding\">57-df-machine-coding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{HaltConf}\">\\(\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{HaltConf}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\">\\(T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\)</span> 使用该固定编号和该固定输入表示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_i(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))\\quad(i,s\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_i(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))\\quad(i,s\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;s\\in\\operatorname{HistCode}\\land C_0(s)=\\operatorname{Init}(\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Last}(s))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;[i+1&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\to\n(\\neg\\operatorname{HaltConf}(C_i(s))\\land C_{i+1}(s)=\\operatorname{Step}(M_e,C_i(s)))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;s\\in\\operatorname{HistCode}\\land C_0(s)=\\operatorname{Init}(\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Last}(s))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;[i+1&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\to\n(\\neg\\operatorname{HaltConf}(C_i(s))\\land C_{i+1}(s)=\\operatorname{Step}(M_e,C_i(s)))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T(e,x,s)\\leftrightarrow T_1(e,x,s)\\quad(e,x,s\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\nT(e,\\vec x,s)\\leftrightarrow T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\quad(\\vec x\\in D_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T(e,x,s)\\leftrightarrow T_1(e,x,s)\\quad(e,x,s\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\nT(e,\\vec x,s)\\leftrightarrow T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\quad(\\vec x\\in D_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Run}(M_e,\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x),j)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Run}(M_e,\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x),j)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\land T_n(e,\\vec x,t)\\to U(s)=U(t)\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\land T_n(e,\\vec x,t)\\to U(s)=U(t)\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里只接受从指定输入出发、逐步遵循实际转移、首次到达停机态的历史。T 不引用 φₑ，故“φₑ 由 T 定义”不是循环定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"6cf31091f58bf0b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-machine-coding","status":"resolved","id":"b9c9625457efede7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-machine-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anc