achine-coding]]；$\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{HaltConf}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。$T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 使用该固定编号和该固定输入表示。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$e,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in D_n$。$D_n$ 及打包约定取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$M_e$ 取 [[57-df-program-numbering]]；$\\operatorname{Word}_n$ 取 [[57-df-encoding]]；$\\operatorname{HistCode},\\operatorname{cdec},U$ 取 [[57-df-machine-coding]]；$\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{HaltConf}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。$T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 使用该固定编号和该固定输入表示。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"e,s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in D_n","display":false},{"tex":"D_n","display":false},{"tex":"M_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Word}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HistCode},\\operatorname{cdec},U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{HaltConf}","display":false},{"tex":"T_n(e,\\vec x,s)","display":false},{"tex":"C_i(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))\\quad(i,s\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&s\\in\\operatorname{HistCode}\\land C_0(s)=\\operatorname{Init}(\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Last}(s))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;[i+1<\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\to\n(\\neg\\operatorname{HaltConf}(C_i(s))\\land C_{i+1}(s)=\\operatorname{Step}(M_e,C_i(s)))].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T(e,x,s)\\leftrightarrow T_1(e,x,s)\\quad(e,x,s\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\nT(e,\\vec x,s)\\leftrightarrow T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\quad(\\vec x\\in D_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Run}(M_e,\\operatorname{Word}_n(\\vec x),j)).","display":true},{"tex":"T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\land T_n(e,\\vec x,t)\\to U(s)=U(t)\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true}],"bytes":1890,"backlinks":[{"id":"b9c9625457efede7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"历史码只编码有限配置列；是否真的是某个程序的停机历史，由独立的 [[57-df-t-predicate]] 检查。U 不调用 φₑ 或 T。"},{"id":"446d13f76de9da28","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathcal P_n$。数值函数图及 $\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$\\mathrm{PartRec}_n,\\mathrm{Rec}_n$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_n$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。编号、输入和输出严格取 [[57-df-program-numbering]]、[[57-df-encoding]]、[[57-df-machine-coding]]；$T_n$ 取 [[57-df-t-predicate]]；相对可计算性取 [[57-df-effective-procedure]]。$\\Psi_e^{(n)}$ 为下式定义的机器部分函数图，不使用尚未定义的 φₑ。$\\chi_{T_n}$ 是平坦输入 $(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n,s)$ 上的总特征函数。"},{"id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in D_n$；$D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。固定 [[57-df-program-numbering]] 的程序编号、[[57-df-t-predicate]] 的实际停机历史关系 $T_n$ 及 [[57-df-machine-coding]] 的总输出提取函数 $U$；不更换编号。$\\mathrm{PartRec}_n$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]，该编号的正规形和有效参数化性质取 [[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]。$\\varphi_e^{(n)}$ 为部分函数图，$\\varphi_e$ 默认为一元实例；多元调用使用同一打包映射。停机与部分值相等取 [[57-df-halt-notation]]。$\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 是下式的谓词见证搜索，只在存在历史时定义；不将广义部分函数搜索与普通集合最小元混淆，参见 [[57-df-minimum-operator]]、[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]。"},{"id":"b1118344012e3e87","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\varphi_e:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 是 [[57-df-phi-e]] 的同一编号的一元部分函数图，而非机器对象本身。$\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow$ 取 [[57-df-halt-notation]]，等价于 $x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)$；$T$ 取 [[57-df-t-predicate]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-234","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"}],"outgoing":["7463e44f61370c84","6cf31091f58bf0b5","b2e96ed477b7b031","b9c9625457efede7","20d4e2ccede99498"]}